### Sample Inbound Callback
POST http://localhost:3000/api/webhooks/callback
Content-Type: application/json
X-Signature: sha256=dummy

{
  "job_id": "job-id",
  "lead_id": "lead-id",
  "status": "sent",
  "provider_message_id": "abc123",
  "error_message": null
}
